{
  "name": "ListCoreGatewayQuotas",
  "summary": "查询账号配额",
  "tags": "配额管理",
  "productshort": "AgentArts",
  "region_id": "cn-southwest-2",
  "paths": {
    "/v1/core/gateway-quotas": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "ListCoreGatewayQuotas",
        "summary": "查询账号配额",
        "description": "获取当前认证账号的有效配额信息,包括配额类型、最小值、最大值、配额值和已使用数量。",
        "tags": [
          "配额管理"
        ],
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-api-service-plane": "Control-plane",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-sec-data-level": "L3",
        "x-apigateway-request-type": "public",
        "x-api-framework": "RestfulAPI",
        "x-api-user": "IAM普通租户",
        "x-api-position": "管理面",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "gateway_id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n网关的唯一标识符。\n网关ID获取方式:\n1. 进入AgentArts平台,在左侧导航栏选择“开发中心 > 组件库 ”,选择“网关”页签。\n2. 在网关列表中“网关名称/ID”处复制网关ID即可。\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及。\n**取值范围:**\n匹配标准的UUID格式(8-4-4-4-12的十六进制数字串,由连字符分隔),符合正则条件^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$。\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n返回的最大结果数。\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及。\n**取值范围:**\nint32,取值范围为1-2条。\n**默认取值:**\n2",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 2,
            "default": 2
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n返回结果偏移量。\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及。\n**取值范围:**\nint32,取值范围为0-100000条。\n**默认取值:**\n0",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100000,
            "default": 0
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功检索账号配额列表",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ListCoreGatewayQuotasResponseBody"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "quotas": [
                  {
                    "type": "gateway_count",
                    "min": 1,
                    "max": 100,
                    "quota": 20,
                    "used": 5
                  }
                ],
                "size": 1,
                "total": 1
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "内部服务器错误",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreGatewayCommonError"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "error_code": "AgentArts.02000500",
                "error_msg": "内部服务器错误"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "ListCoreGatewayQuotasResponseBody": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "quotas",
        "size",
        "total"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "quotas": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n配额列表。\n**取值范围:**\n数组长度为 1-2。",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreGatewayQuota"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 2
        },
        "size": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 2,
          "example": 1,
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n当前页返回的配额数量。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 0-2个。"
        },
        "total": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 2,
          "example": 1,
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n配额总数。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 0-2个。"
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreGatewayCommonError": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "error_code",
        "error_msg"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n错误码。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为固定18个字符,匹配以 AgentArts. 开头、后接恰好8位数字的字符串,符合正则条件^AgentArts\\.[0-9]{8}$。",
          "pattern": "^AgentArts\\.[0-9]{8}$",
          "minLength": 18,
          "maxLength": 18,
          "example": "AgentArts.02000000"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n错误消息。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 1-256 个字符,匹配由字母、数字、空格、中文汉字以及常见中英文标点符号组成的非空字符串,符合正则条件^[a-zA-Z0-9\\s\\一-\\鿿.,!?;:()''\"\\-\\。\\，\\！\\？\\；\\：\\（\\）]+$。",
          "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9\\s\\一-\\鿿.,!?;:()'\"\\-\\。\\，\\！\\？\\；\\：\\（\\）]+$",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 256
        },
        "error_reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n错误原因。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 1-256 个字符,匹配由字母、数字、空格、中文汉字以及常见中英文标点符号组成的非空字符串,符合正则条件^[a-zA-Z0-9\\s\\一-\\鿿.,!?;:()''\"\\-\\。\\，\\！\\？\\；\\：\\（\\）]+$。",
          "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9\\s\\一-\\鿿.,!?;:()'\"\\-\\。\\，\\！\\？\\；\\：\\（\\）]+$",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 256
        },
        "error_suggestion": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n错误处理建议。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 1-256 个字符,匹配由字母、数字、空格、中文汉字以及常见中英文标点符号组成的非空字符串,符合正则条件^[a-zA-Z0-9\\s\\一-\\鿿.,!?;:()''\"\\-\\。\\，\\！\\？\\；\\：\\（\\）]+$。",
          "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9\\s\\一-\\鿿.,!?;:()'\"\\-\\。\\，\\！\\？\\；\\：\\（\\）]+$",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 256
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreGatewayQuota": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "type",
        "min",
        "max",
        "quota",
        "used"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "gateway_count",
            "target_count_per_gateway"
          ],
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n配额类型。\n**取值范围:**\n- `gateway_count`: 网关数量配额,当指定gateway id时,不返回该类型的配额详情。\n- `target_count_per_gateway`: 每个网关的目标服务数量配额,仅当指定了gateway id时,才会返回该类型的配额详情。"
        },
        "min": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 10000,
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n最小允许值。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 1-10000个。"
        },
        "max": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 10000,
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n最大允许值。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 1-10000个。"
        },
        "quota": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 10000,
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n当前配置的配额值。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 1-10000个。"
        },
        "used": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 10000,
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n已使用数量(实时计算)。\n**取值范围:**\n取值为 0-10000个。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "2.0",
  "parameters": {},
  "host": "agentarts.cn-southwest-2.myhuaweicloud.com",
  "base_path": "/",
  "info_version": "v1",
  "method": "get",
  "uri": null
}